{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"f1a0000000000001","type":"text","x":0,"y":-420,"width":4550,"height":260,"text":"# 金融体系与金融中介\n\n先用索取权和资产负债表确认什么是金融中介，再分别回答三组问题：它为什么存在；它怎样转换金额、期限、流动性与风险；这些功能进入市场和非银行链条后，哪些名称可以重叠、哪些风险仍未消失。\n\n每张卡只链接一个可独立回忆或应用的 Markdown 原子。箭头说明语义关系；颜色只表示本图角色，不表示掌握度。原子的来源、前置关系和掌握状态可在 [[知识原子.base|知识原子 Base]] 中查询。"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000002","type":"text","x":1550,"y":0,"width":600,"height":220,"text":"## [[金融体系的资金配置|金融体系连接资金盈余与资金需求]]\n*Function of the financial system*\n\n连接不只是搬运资金；它同时决定融资价格、期限、风险承担与可得性。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000003","type":"text","x":1550,"y":320,"width":600,"height":220,"text":"## [[金融中介|金融中介]]\n*Financial intermediary*\n\n中介以自己的资产负债表连接两端：向资金提供者发行索取权，再持有贷款或证券。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000004","type":"text","x":1550,"y":640,"width":600,"height":240,"text":"## [[直接与间接融资|直接融资与间接融资]]\n*Direct versus indirect finance*\n\n先固定被分类的融资段，再看资金提供者持有最终融资者的证券，还是中介自己的负债。","color":"6"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000005","type":"text","x":0,"y":1050,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[金融交易成本的规模经济|交易成本的规模经济]]\n*Scale economies*\n\n合同、系统、数据和专业人员的固定成本可分摊到大量交易。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000006","type":"text","x":0,"y":1380,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[委托筛选与监督|委托筛选与监督]]\n*Delegated screening and monitoring*\n\n中介集中生产并内部化借款人信息，减少重复调查和搭便车。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000007","type":"text","x":0,"y":1710,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[关系型贷款与软信息|关系型贷款与软信息]]\n*Relationship lending*\n\n长期互动积累难以量化、验证和跨层级传递的情境信息。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000008","type":"text","x":550,"y":1050,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[金融中介规模转换|规模转换]]\n*Scale transformation*\n\n把许多小额索取权汇集成可支持大额融资的资产头寸。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000009","type":"text","x":1100,"y":1050,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[期限转换|期限转换]]\n*Maturity transformation*\n\n以较短期负债支持较长期资产，因而承担续融资风险。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"f1a000000000000a","type":"text","x":1650,"y":1050,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[流动性转换|流动性转换]]\n*Liquidity transformation*\n\n向客户发行易变现索取权，同时持有更难迅速、低损失变现的资产。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"f1a000000000000b","type":"text","x":2200,"y":1050,"width":460,"height":220,"text":"## [[信用与风险转换|信用与风险转换]]\n*Credit and risk transformation*\n\n筛选、分散、资本和优先级重新分配损失，却不会消灭风险。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"f1a000000000000c","type":"text","x":1375,"y":1410,"width":600,"height":240,"text":"## [[期限转换不等于流动性转换|期限转换不等于流动性转换]]\n*Maturity is not liquidity*\n\n合同何时到期与资产今天能否低损失变现是两项不同诊断。","color":"6"},
    {"id":"f1a000000000000d","type":"text","x":1375,"y":1770,"width":600,"height":250,"text":"## [[挤兑火售反馈|挤兑与火售反馈]]\n*Runs and fire-sale feedback*\n\n撤资 → 现金缺口 → 火售 → 价格与抵押品下降 → 更多去杠杆和信贷收缩。","color":"1"},
    {"id":"f1a000000000000e","type":"text","x":3450,"y":320,"width":500,"height":220,"text":"## [[金融中介识别|金融中介识别]]\n*Functional classification*\n\n确认中介后，再按负债承诺、资产用途和转换功能分类；银行不是全部。","color":"6"},
    {"id":"f1a000000000000f","type":"text","x":2850,"y":650,"width":500,"height":230,"text":"## [[直接融资的服务链|直接融资的服务链]]\n*Services in direct finance*\n\n承销、交易、托管和清算可以参与交易，却未必承担最终信用风险。","color":"6"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000010","type":"text","x":2850,"y":1050,"width":500,"height":230,"text":"## [[市场型融资|市场型融资]]\n*Market-based finance*\n\n债券、股票等市场工具与参与机构、基础设施共同向实体经济提供资金。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000011","type":"text","x":3450,"y":650,"width":500,"height":240,"text":"## [[影子银行|影子银行]]\n*Shadow banking*\n\n传统存款银行体系外的信用中介，若伴随类银行脆弱性，才进入这一较窄诊断。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000012","type":"text","x":2850,"y":1410,"width":500,"height":240,"text":"## [[证券化|证券化]]\n*Securitisation*\n\n以一组金融资产的现金流支持向投资者发行证券。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000013","type":"text","x":3450,"y":1050,"width":500,"height":250,"text":"## [[非银行、市场型与影子银行|三个标签不能互换]]\n*Three overlapping labels*\n\n非银行按主体，市场型按渠道和系统，影子银行按中介功能与脆弱性分类。","color":"6"},
    {"id":"f1a0000000000014","type":"text","x":2850,"y":1770,"width":500,"height":250,"text":"## [[证券化不等于去中介化|证券化不等于去中介化]]\n*Securitisation is not disintermediation*\n\n贷款离开发起人资产负债表，不代表筛选、服务、融资、担保和风险转换已经消失。","color":"1"}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"id":"f1ae000000000001","fromNode":"f1a0000000000002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000003","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"资金连接可以通过中介自己的资产负债表完成"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000002","fromNode":"f1a0000000000003","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000004","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"沿索取权判断是否隔着一层中介负债"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000003","fromNode":"f1a0000000000003","fromSide":"right","toNode":"f1a000000000000e","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"定义成立后再按具体承诺与资产分类"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000004","fromNode":"f1a0000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000005","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"多一层资产负债表首先要有成本理由"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000005","fromNode":"f1a0000000000005","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000006","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"除处理交易外还要生产借款人信息"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000006","fromNode":"f1a0000000000006","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000007","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"软信息需要长期反复接触"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000007","fromNode":"f1a0000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000008","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"重新组合金额大小"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000008","fromNode":"f1a0000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000009","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"重新组合合同到期日"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000009","fromNode":"f1a0000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a000000000000a","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"重新组合即时变现能力"},
    {"id":"f1ae00000000000a","fromNode":"f1a0000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a000000000000b","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"重新分配信用损失与承担顺序"},
    {"id":"f1ae00000000000b","fromNode":"f1a0000000000009","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a000000000000c","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"到期日只是第一项诊断"},
    {"id":"f1ae00000000000c","fromNode":"f1a000000000000a","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a000000000000c","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"变现条件是另一项诊断"},
    {"id":"f1ae00000000000d","fromNode":"f1a000000000000c","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a000000000000d","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"两种错配叠加时更易形成撤资与火售"},
    {"id":"f1ae00000000000e","fromNode":"f1a0000000000004","fromSide":"right","toNode":"f1a000000000000f","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"直接持有证券仍离不开市场服务"},
    {"id":"f1ae00000000000f","fromNode":"f1a000000000000f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000010","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"市场工具与基础设施共同形成融资系统"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000010","fromNode":"f1a000000000000e","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000011","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"非银行中介还需检查类银行脆弱性"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000011","fromNode":"f1a0000000000010","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000012","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"资产池现金流可以被组织成市场证券"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000012","fromNode":"f1a0000000000011","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000013","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"影子银行只是三个标签中的较窄诊断"},
    {"id":"f1ae000000000013","fromNode":"f1a0000000000012","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f1a0000000000014","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"交易结构改变不等于中介功能消失"}
  ]
}
